    perspective. <text:span text:style-name='Emphasis'><text:span text:style-name='ecti-1095'>Therapeutic Advances in Gastroenterology</text:span></text:span> <text:span text:style-name='textbf'><text:span text:style-name='ecbx-1095'>9</text:span></text:span>, 229–239 (2016).
    </text:p><text:p text:style-name='p-bibitem'>
<text:bookmark text:name='bibitem18'></text:bookmark>[18] Gilpin, M.  Community-level competition: Asymmetrical dominance.  <text:span text:style-name='Emphasis'><text:span text:style-name='ecti-1095'>Proceedings of the</text:span>
